<section image-layout="blank" id="AICoGjJIf5"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="3LKKJ_VPTX" background-color="accent" padding="28pt 12pt 24pt" colspan="7"><p role="eyebrow">Field guide</p><spacer mode="fill"></spacer><p role="caption">DECISIONS</p><p role="caption">06 / 10</p></grid-item><grid-item id="97Z_v1mszy" padding="18pt 30pt 16pt 28pt" colspan="53"><labels><label variant="outline">Illustrative replacement · validate before use</label></labels><h2 font-size="28pt">Decisions stop the project from repeating old debates</h2><p font-size="16pt">IDs remain stable when dates, owners, or evidence links change.</p><grid spacing="medium" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="fxbxW3sMcC" colspan="27"><table col-widths="[14,46]" header-row="true" borders="rows" striped="false" style="--table-cell-padding:7pt 8pt"><tr><th>ID</th><th>Accepted choice and consequence</th></tr><tr><td><p font-size="16pt"><b>D-01</b></p></td><td><p font-size="16pt"><b>Eight-category taxonomy.</b> Local teams map their language into shared categories instead of creating new queues.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p font-size="16pt"><b>D-02</b></p></td><td><p font-size="16pt"><b>Supervisor-only priority overrides.</b> Urgent exceptions require an available supervisor and a recorded reason.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p font-size="16pt"><b>D-03</b></p></td><td><p font-size="16pt"><b>Phased rollout.</b> Two teams launch first, making exposure and rollback boundaries measurable.</p></td></tr></table></grid-item><grid-item id="5IQ2eDzOId" padding="0" colspan="33"><grid direction="vertical" spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="VChvIMvXCS" background-color="palette-2" padding="12pt 16pt"><p role="eyebrow">D-04 · OPEN · DRIVEN BY R-02</p><h3>Is reporting ready enough for launch?</h3></grid-item><grid-item id="-vQQcxIxXL" background-color="surface" padding="12pt 16pt"><p font-size="16pt">Choose between a controlled daily export and delaying until the two-hour refresh target is met.</p><grid divider="sm neutral-border" padding="8pt 12pt" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="ZOsFq6sioS" colspan="30"><p role="eyebrow">Accountable</p><h4>Product Owner</h4></grid-item><grid-item id="trhiRyFjN4" colspan="30"><p role="eyebrow">Evidence owner</p><h4>Data Lead</h4></grid-item><grid-item id="gvE4wNg43X" colspan="30"><p role="eyebrow">A-06 · Next action</p><p font-size="16pt">Representative-volume benchmark by T+5.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="zUxb5mB259" colspan="30"><p role="eyebrow">Decision forum</p><h4>T+6</h4></grid-item></grid><p font-size="16pt"><b>Launch:</b> on schedule; manual reconciliation. <b>Delay:</b> reporting standard protected; dual operation extended.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>